{
  "Language standard 0.2, revision 1": "语言标准 0.2，修订 1",
  "The draft consolidated into a <a href=\"spec/0.2/\">formal standard</a>: English normative, with a Chinese version and the standard word list; the web pages, PDFs and Markdown are all built from one source.": "草案整理为<a href=\"spec/0.2/\">正式语言标准</a>：以英文为正式规范，附中文版与标准词表；网页、PDF 与 Markdown 均由同一份源生成。",
  "Learn more": "了解更多",
  "Toolkit 0.1: web and desktop viewers": "工具链 0.1：网页版与桌面版查看器",
  "The runtime, the SPICE and Spectre adapters, the renderer and the <code>rnl</code> command; <a href=\"tools.html\">the web viewer</a> goes online and the Windows desktop viewer 0.1.0 is released. They open a netlist with RNL and draw what has coordinates.": "运行库、SPICE 与 Spectre 适配器、渲染器与 <code>rnl</code> 命令；<a href=\"tools.html\">网页版查看器</a>上线，Windows 桌面版查看器 0.1.0 发布。可打开带有 RNL 的网表，并绘制出具有坐标的部分。",
  "npm preview package": "npm 预览包",
  "The core as WebAssembly is published to npm as a preview: <code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code>, under the tag <code>next</code>.": "核心的 WebAssembly 版本以预览包发布至 npm：<code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code>，标签为 <code>next</code>。",
  "Language standard 0.3, revisions 1 and 2": "语言标准 0.3，修订 1 与 2",
  "The solver must write back every decision it makes, so that a viewer that does not solve draws what it drew: objects that no name reaches have numbers, and the routes of automatic wires are written back. The standard series 0.3 spells its names out in full; the <a href=\"spec/0.3/\">formal standard</a> comes with a Chinese version, and files of 0.2 still read.": "求解器必须将每项决定写回文件，让不执行求解的查看器也能绘出相同的原理图：无法通过名字指代的对象具有编号，自动导线的路径也会写回。标准系列 0.3 将名称完整拼出；<a href=\"spec/0.3/\">正式语言标准</a>附有中文版，且仍可读取 0.2 的文件。",
  "The RNL skill package and the page for agents": "RNL skill 包与“给 agent”页面",
  "A skill package for AI agents (Agent Skills format): a short guide, a reference to the standard packages, notes on the tools and examples; this site has <a href=\"agents.html\">a page for agents</a> and an <code>llms.txt</code>.": "专为 AI agent 设计的 skill 包（Agent Skills 格式）：包含简明指南、标准包参考、工具说明与示例；本站新增<a href=\"agents.html\">给 agent 的页面</a>与 <code>llms.txt</code>。",
  "Desktop viewer 0.1.1": "桌面版查看器 0.1.1",
  "The <a href=\"tools.html\">desktop viewer</a> edits the text and saves it, solves and shows the result as a preview, and lists the objects that are not drawn; it reads files of language 0.3.": "<a href=\"tools.html\">桌面版查看器</a>支持编辑并保存文本、求解并将结果显示为预览，且能列出未绘制的对象；支持读取语言标准 0.3 的文件。",
  "Public extensions and SKY130": "公开扩展包与 SKY130",
  "<code>eda-style</code> provides EDA schematic symbols and styling; the SKY130 package is renamed <code>pdk-sky130</code>. Extensions are included explicitly, while the core bundles only the standard packages.": "<code>eda-style</code> 提供 EDA 原理图符号与外观样式；SKY130 包更名为 <code>pdk-sky130</code>。扩展包按显式引用方式加载，而核心仅内置标准包。",
  "Related changes": "相关变更",
  "npm previews 13 and 14": "npm 预览包 13 与 14",
  "<code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code> publishes <code>0.1.0-preview.13</code> and <code>preview.14</code>, continuing to distribute the WebAssembly core under <code>next</code>.": "<code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code> 发布 <code>0.1.0-preview.13</code> 与 <code>preview.14</code>，继续通过 <code>next</code> 标签分发核心的 WebAssembly 版本。",
  "Interactive drawings in other pages": "嵌入其他网页的交互式原理图",
  "The web viewer gains a canvas-only embedding mode. Other pages can open netlists, navigate levels, fit the drawing and change its background through messages without reloading.": "网页版查看器新增仅显示画布的嵌入模式。其他网页可通过消息接口打开网表、切换层级、适应窗口缩放及修改背景，无需重新加载。",
  "Site navigation, logo and package gallery": "网站导航、Logo 与包图库",
  "The site gains shared navigation and sidebars, package groups for standard series, extensions and PDKs, an interactive circuit logo, and an origin toggle in the gallery.": "网站配备统一的导航栏与侧栏、按标准系列、扩展包与 PDK 分组的包图库、交互式电路 Logo，以及图库中的原点显示开关。",
  "Separate symbol and style packages": "符号与样式拆分为独立公开包",
  "<code>eda-symbol</code> supplies 137 schematic symbols; the independent <code>eda-style</code> styles standard, custom and EDA symbols. Either package can be used on its own.": "<code>eda-symbol</code> 提供 137 个原理图符号；独立的 <code>eda-style</code> 为标准、自定义与 EDA 符号设置样式。两个包均可单独使用。",
  "Public packages through a catalog": "通过目录清单分发公开包",
  "Optional public packages move to <code>rnl-packages</code>. The viewers and site fetch versioned files from its catalog and verify SHA256; the standard packages remain built into the core.": "可选公开包移至 <code>rnl-packages</code> 仓库。查看器与网站从其目录清单获取带版本号的文件并校验 SHA256；标准包则仍内置于核心中。",
  "Open the complete Viewer from another site": "从外部网站打开完整查看器",
  "The complete Viewer and embedded mode share an import API for netlists, URLs and exact public-package versions. Other sites can open or reuse a Viewer tab and cancel superseded imports.": "完整查看器与嵌入模式共用导入接口，支持网表、URL 与指定版本的公开包。外部网站可打开或复用查看器标签页，并取消已被新请求取代的导入。",
  "Desktop viewer 0.1.4 and npm preview 15": "桌面版查看器 0.1.4 与 npm 预览包 15",
  "The Viewer adds English and Chinese UI, Auto Include, compilation and drawing caches, and background preloading; <code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code> publishes <code>0.1.0-preview.15</code>.": "查看器新增中英文界面、自动引入（Auto Include）、编译与绘图缓存以及后台预加载；<code>@rich-netlist/runtime</code> 发布 <code>0.1.0-preview.15</code>。",
  "Language standard 0.4": "语言标准 0.4",
  "Planned: symbols chosen by the number of terminals; the new <code>@SOLVER-CONFIG</code>.": "规划中：按端子数量选择符号；新增 <code>@SOLVER-CONFIG</code>。",
  "The solver’s objectives, second version": "求解器优化目标，第二版",
  "Planned: the names of the standard package move out of the solver into its configuration, so that in a file of 0.3 the objectives for current direction, ground direction and signal flow have something to act on.": "规划中：标准包中的名称由求解器内部移至其配置中，使 0.3 文件中的电流方向、接地方向与信号流向等目标有对应的作用对象。",
  "The first Linux AppImage and deb release adds the Library, search paths, hairlines and a dark background.": null,
  "Adds keyboard navigation through levels, new windows, editing mode and loading progress, with virtualized text for large netlists.": null,
  "Adds English and Chinese UI, Auto Include, compilation and drawing caches, and background preloading, with improved cross-file navigation.": null,
  "Adds interactive usage inspection and schematic overlays, configurable netlist colors, background web package discovery and Library ZIP downloads, and fixes net-label highlighting and applying downloaded edits.": null,
  "Adds current-direction arrows, lighter usage frames computed by the core, encoding-preserving saves with explicit UTF-8 options on the desktop and single-line Library paths, and fixes panel keys pressed during startup.": null,
  "The first macOS packages of the desktop viewer, for Apple Silicon and Intel, and Chinese text in the interface and editor no longer shows as boxes on Linux without Chinese system fonts.": null,
  "RNL Viewer 0.4.0: each file's parse format, SPICE or Spectre, can be set in the Library; Shift+R shows current directions; PATH can take a folder with its sub-folders; panel keys work at once during startup; the subcircuit highlight can be set in the Color Scheme.": null,
  "RNL Viewer 0.4.1: projects (Save or Download Project, Open Project, and on the web Download and Load Manifest) replace Download Library; File gains Export Image as SVG or PNG; the web viewer opens external manifests, such as the gallery's designs, with ?manifest=; a hint when a subcircuit has no definition.": null,
  "RNL Viewer 0.5.0: the web viewer works on phones and tablets, with touch gestures, the drawing and the side panel as two pages on a phone and the side panel under the drawing on a tablet held upright; a manifest's display settings are offered and applied while its files are shown; the languages of the interface come from the project's list.": "RNL Viewer 0.5.0：网页版查看器支持手机与平板电脑及触控手势，在手机上将原理图与侧栏分为两页，在竖屏平板上将侧栏置于原理图下方；显示清单中的文件时会提示并套用清单随附的显示设置；界面语言列表取自工程配置。",
  "The first core release: ready-to-run rnl executables for Windows, Linux and macOS, and the npm package now carries the core's version, 0.2.0.": null,
  "Core 0.3.0: rnl render can draw usage frames and current directions, saving keeps a file's original encoding, and nine fixes to reading and drawing land.": null,
  "Core 0.4.0: each file of a netlist is read in its own format, SPICE or Spectre, which can be set file by file; the CLI gains --format and rnl formats, and the npm package takes formats too. Also fixes writing ORIENT(\"R0\") and a warning given where 0.3 gives none.": null,
  "Core 0.4.1: netlists that use rnl-std-no-labels, as every Analog Canvas export does, can declare structures; a hint for a subcircuit that no file read defines and that is drawn as a box of its terminals; the npm package gains @rich-netlist/runtime/manifest, which reads and writes manifests and projects.": null,
  "Core 0.5.0: a role can take every kind of object of 9.4, labels, texts, annotations and bundles among them; the editor interface's snapshot gives each usage's parameters as its statement writes them; manifests carry display settings that a viewer offers to apply.": "核心 0.5.0：角色可接受 9.4 所列的每一种对象（包含标签、文字、标注与叠画 bundle）；编辑器接口的快照按语句的写法提供每个用例的参数；清单可携带显示设置供查看器提示并套用。",
  "Core 0.5.1: the edit op add-usage writes a usage's parameters, which the snapshot reads back as given, so a tool can write the parameters of a definition through the runtime.": "核心 0.5.1：编辑操作 add-usage 会写入用例的参数，快照会按写入时的原样读回，因此工具可通过运行库写入定义的参数。",
  "Core 0.5.2: a tool can write an object's colours and other style properties through the edit ops set and add-usage, and read them back from the snapshot.": "核心 0.5.2：工具可通过编辑操作 set 与 add-usage 写入对象的颜色及其他样式属性，并从快照中读回。"
}
